Check the input ranks in the kernels and fail the run with an error instead.
The float MatMul kernel has the same loop and gets the same check. The error
differs from the CPU EP's "MatMul dimension mismatch", so exclude oneDNN from
the test, as is already done for DirectML. Upstream main still has the same
code (checked on 2026-10-28).

